        "verse": 6
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 47,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "“‘You sword of the LORD, how long will it be before you are quiet? Put yourself back into your scabbard; rest, and be still.’",
      "ko": "여호와의 칼이여 네가 언제까지 쉬지 않겠느냐 네 집에 들어가서 가만히 쉴찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "7513430821a41215e0836255cc830a2a7c596920b70c59e6a4302e0d7fe7840d",
      "translation_text_hash": "41a4252ac7e7bc526ffbc707771e03d36cba5f7dca661d4317927e28175d6a64",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와의 칼이여 네가 언제까지 쉬지 않겠느냐 네 집에 들어가서 가만히 쉴찌어다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "41a4252ac7e7bc526ffbc707771e03d36cba5f7dca661d4317927e28175d6a64"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JER:47:7",
      "sequence": 20081,
      "chapter_label": "JER 47",
      "verse_label": "7",
      "locator": {
        "book": "JER",
